ions include the defining characteristics of bandwidth, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Signals and Systems', 'Active'), ('KCR_000913', 'poles and zeros', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Signals and Systems', 'Technical Concept', 'Values of the complex-frequency variable that make a system function infinite or zero, respectively.', 'Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of poles and zeros within Signals and Systems, particularly where the Laplace Transform and System Analysis module establishes its technical context.', 'Core considerations include the defining characteristics of poles and zeros, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'Values of the complex-frequency variable that make a system function infinite or zero, respectively. Within Laplace Transform and System Analysis, the concept covers Applies to the analysis, design, implementation, interpretation, or evaluation of poles and zeros within Signals and Systems, particularly where the Laplace Transform and System Analysis module establishes its technical context. Key technical considerations are Core considerations include the defining characteristics of poles and zeros, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it.', 'poles and zeros; Core considerations include the defining characteristics of poles and zeros, its governing relationships or mechanisms, applicable assumptions and constraints, and criteria used to analyse or evaluate it; Signals and Systems', 'Active'), ('KCR_000914', 'Z transform', 'Engineering & Technology', 'Signals and Systems', 'Technical Concept', 'A transform for discrete-time signals and systems that generalises frequency-domain analysis using a complex variable.', 'Applies to the a